<!--
  SAMPLE Tally "Masters" export (List of Accounts / Ledgers).
  Seeded here from state/customers.json so the format is ready to use.

  To make Tally the source of truth for the /payments customer typeahead:
    1. In Tally: Gateway of Tally > Display > List of Accounts (or export
       Ledgers as Masters). Export as XML.
    2. Commit it as state/master.xml (replace this sample's data).
    3. In payments/config.js set  MASTER_XML_URL: "../state/master.xml"
  The app reads every <LEDGER> under a "Sundry Debtors"-type PARENT as a
  customer name (falling back to all ledgers if parents aren't marked).
-->
